flowchart LR
    subgraph Mechanism["CCF mechanism (single access path)"]
        CP["Control Plane<br/>versioned-URI to hash mapping (D-IMPL-26)"]
        L2["L2 Context Assembly<br/>(only writer to L3)"]
        L3["L3 Context Graph<br/>(live state on GraphStore, D-IMPL-02)"]
        ReplayEng["Replay engine +<br/>fidelity lifecycle (D-IMPL-50)"]
        L2 --> L3
    end

    subgraph Store["ArtifactStoreProtocol (D-IMPL-26/27)"]
        Proto["ArtifactStoreProtocol"]
        MCPImpl["MCP-backed reference store<br/>(separate server contract)"]
        FileImpl["File-backed dev store"]
        Proto --- MCPImpl
        Proto --- FileImpl
    end

    subgraph Classes["Immutable artifact classes (D-IMPL-27 mutability split)"]
        RR["Decision Replay records"]
        Snap["Graph-substate + index snapshots"]
        CPAtRest["Context Products at rest"]
        Bundles["Control Plane bundles"]
        NoHard["No-Hardcoding artifacts<br/>(agent/task/prompt/skill)"]
    end

    CP -->|"resolve + put/get<br/>(hash or versioned URI)"| Proto
    ReplayEng -->|"exact-version reads,<br/>never @latest"| Proto
    Proto --- Classes
    Store -.->|"retrieved artifacts enter the graph<br/>ONLY via L2 — no direct store edge to L3"| L2
